    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But it's not just weight, Kaelen. It's like... the world itself is wrong now. Every breath feels like a mistake. I keep thinking that if the pain just stopped... if I could just finally be still... everything would be quiet. Do you think it's wrong to want that? To just want the noise to stop?",
